stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> TopLayerReset
    TopLayerReset --> TopLayerInitialize: reset requested
    TopLayerInitialize --> TopLayerConnect: config loaded and BottomLayer prepared
    TopLayerConnect --> TopLayerKeepAliveServerReceive: connect ACK and first keepalive proven
    TopLayerKeepAliveServerReceive --> TopLayerKeepAliveClientSend: valid server keepalive request received
    TopLayerKeepAliveClientSend --> TopLayerKeepAliveServerReceive: one client response sent

    TopLayerConnect --> TopLayerError: TopLayer failures >= 3
    TopLayerKeepAliveServerReceive --> TopLayerError: TopLayer failures >= 3
    TopLayerKeepAliveClientSend --> TopLayerError: TopLayer failures >= 3
    TopLayerError --> TopLayerReset: explicit operator reset

    note right of TopLayerConnect
      BottomLayer retries up to 3 times on:
      - Wi-Fi/TCP link loss
      - checksum (CRC) error
      - connect/keepalive timeout
      Retry exhaustion:
      - Auto Reconnect ON: reset counters and retry connect
      - Auto Reconnect OFF: escalate to TopLayer failure
    end note
